adr: ADR-1399, ADR-1464
evidence: RTX 4090, --precision max: the kernels store every window's terms and the host adds each frame sum in the CPU's raster order (ADR-1464). The constructed 64x64 frame of core/test/float_ssim_order_frame.h, on which a per-block sum returned 0xb4e2b621, returns the CPU's 0xb4e2b622 (test_cuda_float_ssim_order). 9828 of 9828 values identical to --backend cpu on Netflix 576x324 at 8 to 16 bit and 4:2:2, 1080p checkerboards, Sparks 10 bit, BBB 4K 200 frames and at 16 bit, full-range noise at 8 to 16 bit and at 40x40 to 64x64, bright 16-bit 1080p, with enable_lcs, scale 1 to 3, enable_db and clip_db; 880 000 of 880 000 on 220 000 noise frames at 64x64.
